Copyright (c) 2019 XMind Ltd., MIT License.

Upstream source: https://github.com/xmindltd/xmind-viewer
Source revision reviewed: 272b324bd82ea8567739c6617154d8d2556f6b50

Ported algorithms:
- src/structure/baseMap.ts: _getWeight, calcRightSideCount, calcSidePos
- src/structure/leftAndRight.ts: getChildrenSize and
  calcAttachedChildrenPosByDirection
- src/view/renderEngine/topicShape/brushes.ts: curveHorizon
- The TaleWisp adapter measures wrapped Russian label widths, preserves the
  canonical World-left / History-right order for its two primary branches,
  and connects edges to the core circle, topic ovals, and leaf rails.

The legacy XMind view-controller runtime and render stack are not included.

The concept map also bundles Rough.js 4.6.6 (MIT), from
https://github.com/rough-stuff/rough. Its deterministic SVG sketch rendering
uses bundled MIT dependencies: hachure-fill 0.5.2, path-data-parser 0.1.0,
points-on-curve 0.2.0, and points-on-path 0.2.1. Their license texts are in
ROUGHJS-LICENSE and roughjs-dependencies/.

